{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00440",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.55,
      "end_seconds": 4.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Good morning, you know, doctor. Can I come in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.08,
      "end_seconds": 9.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "Yes, come in, take a seat. What can I do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 10.42,
      "end_seconds": 21.33,
      "duration_seconds": 10.91,
      "text": "So, hello, doctor, I came in with them, if that's okay. Oh, it's a high fever, doctor. She didn't want to come, but I insisted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.63,
      "end_seconds": 23.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "When did you first notice it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.19,
      "end_seconds": 25.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "About... well, one week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.97,
      "end_seconds": 31.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.16,
      "end_seconds": 68.23,
      "duration_seconds": 33.07,
      "text": "Honestly, a few times a day. It's mild, honestly. Only paracetamol, and it's not much. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite. As for severe body pain, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before. Hmm, with severe body pain, yes, moving around. That makes it worse. Oh, um, and pain behind my eyes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.46,
      "end_seconds": 78.14,
      "duration_seconds": 8.68,
      "text": "Uh, um, with pain behind my eyes, it's worse with moving my eyes. Oh, and a skin rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.86,
      "end_seconds": 81.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "How would you describe it, mild, moderate, severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.6,
      "end_seconds": 83.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "I'd say moderate."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.34,
      "end_seconds": 87.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "Any cough or breathlessness at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.86,
      "end_seconds": 92.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "Um, uh, no, none of that at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.71,
      "end_seconds": 98.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.96,
      "text": "Any bleeding from the gums, vomiting or blood in the stool at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.83,
      "end_seconds": 106.56,
      "duration_seconds": 6.73,
      "text": "Well, no bleeding from the gums, vomiting or blood in the stool, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.1,
      "end_seconds": 108.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.26,
      "end_seconds": 111.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Nothing there, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.4,
      "end_seconds": 114.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Does anything run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.75,
      "end_seconds": 120.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "I mean, my grandmother had breast cancer. My sister has epilepsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.42,
      "end_seconds": 125.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "Right, moving on to your background, any past medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.82,
      "end_seconds": 140.55,
      "duration_seconds": 14.73,
      "text": "High blood pressure, for about ten years. I just want to get back to normal, really. I've, I've had diabetes, yes. I did try to ignore it for a while."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.03,
      "end_seconds": 147.4,
      "duration_seconds": 5.37,
      "text": "Yes, I can see the high blood pressure in your file as well. Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.73,
      "end_seconds": 151.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "So, uh, no, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.47,
      "end_seconds": 157.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "Okay, do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.43,
      "end_seconds": 162.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "Um, you know, yes, ibuprofen. I get stomach pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.7,
      "end_seconds": 167.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "Any medication at the moment, including things from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.1,
      "end_seconds": 178.28,
      "duration_seconds": 10.18,
      "text": "Hmm, I'm on ramipril, 5 milligrams, every morning. Um, um, it's metformin, 500 milligrams, twice a day for my sugar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 179.18,
      "end_seconds": 188.94,
      "duration_seconds": 9.76,
      "text": "Oh, um, doctor, I think the last prescription for the metformin was 250 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.34,
      "end_seconds": 193.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "Right. Do you happen to have the current prescription here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 195.08,
      "end_seconds": 210.33,
      "duration_seconds": 15.25,
      "text": "Hmm, uh, no, I left it at home. It's, It's Dolo, 650 milligrams, when I get the fever. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.17,
      "end_seconds": 214.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Let's get your blood pressure and the other basics."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.57,
      "end_seconds": 228.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "Okay, give me a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.08,
      "end_seconds": 267.12,
      "duration_seconds": 18.04,
      "text": "Okay: BP is 107 over 70, pulse 102, temperature is 38.7 degrees. I'll be straight with you about how this works. Most of what we see in clinic turns out to be manageable, and the history you give me is often more useful than any single test, so thank you for being so detailed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 268.43,
      "end_seconds": 271.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "Hmm, thank you, that really helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.29,
      "end_seconds": 275.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "Can I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.05,
      "end_seconds": 279.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Now I'm going to check this part."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.75,
      "end_seconds": 298.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "Your tummy is soft, a little tender under the ribs on the right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.88,
      "end_seconds": 301.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "Right, open wide for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.29,
      "end_seconds": 316.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "There's a faint rash on your forearms, it blanches when I press."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 320.66,
      "end_seconds": 348.72,
      "duration_seconds": 28.06,
      "text": "That's fine, you can get dressed. Thanks for bearing with me. Now that I've had a look, I can put the whole picture together. Right, here's what I'm thinking. I think we're dealing with a febrile illness that could be dengue at this stage. I can't rule out a viral flu-like illness yet. We should do a malaria test for fever. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 349.79,
      "end_seconds": 359.98,
      "duration_seconds": 10.19,
      "text": "Let's get a dengue test, for fever. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture. Any scans or blood work done already?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 361.41,
      "end_seconds": 371.6,
      "duration_seconds": 10.19,
      "text": "Um, I had a full blood count done at another clinic last year. I don't have the report with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 372.29,
      "end_seconds": 402.62,
      "duration_seconds": 30.33,
      "text": "Please avoid ibuprofen or any anti-inflammatory painkillers for now, stick with paracetamol only. Try to get to bed and wake up at the same time each day, and keep your phone away from the bed. Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 405.81,
      "end_seconds": 408.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Okay, you know, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 410.9,
      "end_seconds": 419.08,
      "duration_seconds": 8.18,
      "text": "If you notice any bleeding or you can't keep fluids down, or you feel really unwell, please don't wait, come to the emergency department."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 419.56,
      "end_seconds": 420.26,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Understood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 420.91,
      "end_seconds": 424.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again after the results are back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 424.87,
      "end_seconds": 426.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "Okay, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 427.92,
      "end_seconds": 432.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "Alright, I think we've covered it. Do you have any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 432.87,
      "end_seconds": 437.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "Well, okay, thank you. I'll get started on all of that."
    }
  ]
}